---
title: V60 4:6 method (basic) by Tetsu Kasuya
source: https://beanrockcoffee.com/coffee-recipes/v60-4-6-method-basic/
filter: paper
---

@V60 20g 300g -- water just off the boil
grind coarse

/rinse -- preheat with 100g of water, then discard it
/level-bed
0:00 60g ~10s bloom spiral
0:45 120g ~10s spiral
1:30 180g ~10s spiral
2:15 240g ~10s spiral
3:00 300g ~10s spiral

target 3:30 -- remove the dripper
